  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.1 — Bug fix: DelegateResiliencePolicyProvider now caches the built ResiliencePolicy after the first request,\n            matching the behavior of a static provider. Previously the lambda was invoked on every call, causing\n            stateful policies (Circuit Breaker, Rate Limiter, Bulkhead, Hedge) to lose their state between requests.\n\n            v1.2.0 — Policy providers & partitioned rate limiting:\n            - IResiliencePolicyProvider<TRequest>: declare policies in a separate class, keeping commands clean.\n            - services.AddResiliencePolicy<T>(lambda): inline registration without a class.\n            - services.AddResiliencePolicyProvider<T,TProvider>(): class-based registration for DI-dependent providers.\n            - IGlobalResiliencePolicyProvider / services.AddGlobalResiliencePolicy(): fallback policy for all requests.\n            - RateLimiterOptions.PartitionKeyResolver: per-user/IP rate limiting via a key selector func.\n            - IResilient marked [Obsolete] — use AddResiliencePolicy<T>() instead.\n\n            v1.1.0 — Package structure: now uses Vali-Mediator as NuGet dependency instead of local ProjectReference.\n\n            v1.0.1 — Documentation: enabled XML documentation file for full IntelliSense support.\n\n            v1.0.0 — Initial release:\n            - RetryPolicy: Fixed / Linear / Exponential / ExponentialWithJitter / Custom backoff, per-exception and per-ErrorType conditions, OnRetry callback.\n            - CircuitBreakerPolicy: sliding-window failure tracking, Closed → Open → HalfOpen state machine, configurable thresholds, callbacks.\n            - TimeoutPolicy: Optimistic (CancellationToken) and Pessimistic (Task.WhenAny) strategies.\n            - FallbackPolicy: typed fallback value or factory, conditional activation, OnFallback callback.\n            - BulkheadPolicy: semaphore-based concurrency limiter with optional queue, OnRejected callback.\n            - ResiliencePolicy: composable fluent builder combining all policies.\n            - ResiliencePresets: ForExternalApi, ForDatabase, ForCritical, NoResilience.\n            - Vali-Mediator integration: IResilient interface + ResilienceBehavior pipeline.\n            - CircuitBreakerRegistry: keyed singleton registry for sharing circuit state across calls.",
